## 4. Implementation Notes

### 4.1 Redis Rate-Limit Counter
```python
def check_rate_limit(session_id: str, client_ip: str) -> bool:
    key = f"verify:attempt:{client_ip}:{session_id}"
    attempts = redis.incr(key)
    if attempts == 1:
        redis.expire(key, 300)  # 5 minutes
    return attempts <= 5
```

### 4.2 Gateway Configuration
```nginx
location /api/v1/verification/ {
    proxy_pass http://televerify_backend;
    proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $http_x_forwarded_for;  # passes client-supplied value
}
```
